.SH "NAME"
nvme-ocp-hardware-component-log \- retrieve hardware component log
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.nf
\fInvme\fR [<global\-options>] \fIocp hardware\-component\-log\fR <device>
                        [\-\-comp\-id=<num> | \-i <num>]
                        [\-\-list | \-l]
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
Retrieve hardware component log\&.
.sp
The <device> parameter is mandatory NVMe character device (ex: /dev/nvme0)\&.
.sp
This will only work on OCP compliant devices supporting this feature\&. Results for any other device are undefined\&.
.sp
On success it returns 0, error code otherwise\&.
